<title>HONG KONG: Applied Intl in talks to sell RJP stake.</title>
<headline>Applied Intl in talks to sell RJP stake.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applied International Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday it was in preliminary negotiations with a third party regarding the possible sale of its 41.84 percent stake in RJP Electronics Ltd.</p>
<p>&quot;However, up to the date of this announcement, no binding agreement has been entered into,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Applied International shares closed at HK$0.62 on Monday and RJP Electronics at HK$0.58.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
</text>
